# Local Blender workspace: scripts, renders, exports, asset bundles. Never committed,
# except the working scenes in scenes/ (stored through Git LFS, see /.gitattributes).
*
!.gitignore
!scenes/
!scenes/**
*.blend1
# Hand skin texture pipeline: scripts, Codex prompts, the lab journal, and what cannot be
# made again for free: the Codex pictures (raw, aligned, touch-ups), the UV and the baked map
# (PNGs through Git LFS). Renders, sheets and .blend stay local; the scene is in
# scenes/hand-skin.blend. See docs/HAND_SKIN_TEXTURE.md.
!labs/
!labs/mano-reference-20261018/
!labs/mano-reference-20261018/hand-texture-20261019/
!labs/mano-reference-20261018/hand-texture-20261019/*.py
!labs/mano-reference-20261018/hand-texture-20261019/*.md
!labs/mano-reference-20261018/hand-texture-20261019/retouch-targets.json
labs/mano-reference-20261018/hand-texture-20261019/diag_uv_weights.py
!labs/mano-reference-20261018/hand-texture-20261019/arm-uv.json
!labs/mano-reference-20261018/hand-texture-20261019/bake/
!labs/mano-reference-20261018/hand-texture-20261019/bake/albedo-4096.png
!labs/mano-reference-20261018/hand-texture-20261019/generated/
!labs/mano-reference-20261018/hand-texture-20261019/generated/*.png
labs/mano-reference-20261018/hand-texture-20261019/generated/sheet.png
!labs/mano-reference-20261018/hand-texture-20261019/generated-spread/
!labs/mano-reference-20261018/hand-texture-20261019/generated-spread/*.png
!labs/mano-reference-20261018/hand-texture-20261019/generated-fix/
!labs/mano-reference-20261018/hand-texture-20261019/generated-fix/fix-*.png
!labs/mano-reference-20261018/hand-texture-20261019/generated-seam/
!labs/mano-reference-20261018/hand-texture-20261019/generated-seam/seam-*.png
!labs/mano-reference-20261018/hand-texture-20261019/generated-aligned/
!labs/mano-reference-20261018/hand-texture-20261019/generated-aligned/*
labs/mano-reference-20261018/hand-texture-20261019/generated-aligned/*-overlay.png
labs/mano-reference-20261018/hand-texture-20261019/generated-aligned/*sheet.png
!labs/mano-reference-20261018/hand-texture-20261019/generated-spread-aligned/
!labs/mano-reference-20261018/hand-texture-20261019/generated-spread-aligned/*
